{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"terraform-aws-snippets","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.0.0","displayName":"Terraform AWS Snippets","description":"Provider, VPC, EC2, S3, IAM, RDS, security groups and outputs for Terraform on AWS.","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Snippets"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"snippets":[{"language":"Terraform and HCL","path":"snippets/terraform-and-hcl.json"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"snippets/terraform-and-hcl.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"AWS provider\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"tfaws\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"terraform {\",\n      \"  required_providers {\",\n      \"    aws = {\",\n      \"      source  = \\\"hashicorp/aws\\\"\",\n      \"      version = \\\"~> 5.0\\\"\",\n      \"    }\",\n      \"  }\",\n      \"}\",\n      \"\",\n      \"provider \\\"aws\\\" {\",\n      \"  region = \\\"${1:eu-west-1}\\\"\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"The AWS provider\"\n  },\n  \"S3 bucket\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"tfs3\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"resource \\\"aws_s3_bucket\\\" \\\"${1:main}\\\" {\",\n      \"  bucket = \\\"${2:my-bucket-name}\\\"\",\n      \"}\",\n      \"\",\n      \"resource \\\"aws_s3_bucket_public_access_block\\\" \\\"${1:main}\\\" {\",\n      \"  bucket                  = aws_s3_bucket.${1:main}.id\",\n      \"  block_public_acls       = true\",\n      \"  block_public_policy     = true\",\n      \"  ignore_public_acls      = true\",\n      \"  restrict_public_buckets = true\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"An S3 bucket\"\n  },\n  \"EC2 instance\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"tfec2\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"resource \\\"aws_instance\\\" \\\"${1:web}\\\" {\",\n      \"  ami           = \\\"${2:ami-0abcdef1234567890}\\\"\",\n      \"  instance_type = \\\"${3:t3.micro}\\\"\",\n      \"  subnet_id     = ${4:aws_subnet.public.id}\",\n      \"  vpc_security_group_ids = [${5:aws_security_group.web.id}]\",\n      \"\",\n      \"  tags = {\",\n      \"    Name = \\\"${1:web}\\\"\",\n      \"  }\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"An EC2 instance\"\n  },\n  \"Security group\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"tfsg\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"resource \\\"aws_security_group\\\" \\\"${1:web}\\\" {\",\n      \"  name   = \\\"${1:web}\\\"\",\n      \"  vpc_id = ${2:aws_vpc.main.id}\",\n      \"\",\n      \"  ingress {\",\n      \"    from_port   = ${3:443}\",\n      \"    to_port     = ${3:443}\",\n      \"    protocol    = \\\"tcp\\\"\",\n      \"    cidr_blocks = [\\\"0.0.0.0/0\\\"]\",\n      \"  }\",\n      \"\",\n      \"  egress {\",\n      \"    from_port   = 0\",\n      \"    to_port     = 0\",\n      \"    protocol    = \\\"-1\\\"\",\n      \"    cidr_blocks = [\\\"0.0.0.0/0\\\"]\",\n      \"  }\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A security group\"\n  },\n  \"VPC\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"tfvpc\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"resource \\\"aws_vpc\\\" \\\"${1:main}\\\" {\",\n      \"  cidr_block           = \\\"${2:10.0.0.0/16}\\\"\",\n      \"  enable_dns_hostnames = true\",\n      \"}\",\n      \"\",\n      \"resource \\\"aws_subnet\\\" \\\"public\\\" {\",\n      \"  vpc_id                  = aws_vpc.${1:main}.id\",\n      \"  cidr_block              = \\\"${3:10.0.1.0/24}\\\"\",\n      \"  map_public_ip_on_launch = true\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A VPC with a subnet\"\n  },\n  \"IAM role\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"tfiam\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"resource \\\"aws_iam_role\\\" \\\"${1:app}\\\" {\",\n      \"  name = \\\"${1:app}\\\"\",\n      \"\",\n      \"  assume_role_policy = jsonencode({\",\n      \"    Version = \\\"2012-10-17\\\"\",\n      \"    Statement = [{\",\n      \"      Action    = \\\"sts:AssumeRole\\\"\",\n      \"      Effect    = \\\"Allow\\\"\",\n      \"      Principal = { Service = \\\"${2:ec2.amazonaws.com}\\\" }\",\n      \"    }]\",\n      \"  })\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"An IAM role\"\n  },\n  \"RDS Postgres\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"tfrds\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"resource \\\"aws_db_instance\\\" \\\"${1:main}\\\" {\",\n      \"  identifier        = \\\"${1:main}\\\"\",\n      \"  engine            = \\\"postgres\\\"\",\n      \"  engine_version    = \\\"16\\\"\",\n      \"  instance_class    = \\\"${2:db.t3.micro}\\\"\",\n      \"  allocated_storage = ${3:20}\",\n      \"  db_name           = \\\"${4:app}\\\"\",\n      \"  username          = var.db_user\",\n      \"  password          = var.db_password\",\n      \"  skip_final_snapshot = true\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"An RDS Postgres instance\"\n  },\n  \"Lambda function\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"tflambda\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"resource \\\"aws_lambda_function\\\" \\\"${1:fn}\\\" {\",\n      \"  function_name = \\\"${1:fn}\\\"\",\n      \"  role          = aws_iam_role.${2:lambda}.arn\",\n      \"  handler       = \\\"${3:index.handler}\\\"\",\n      \"  runtime       = \\\"${4:nodejs22.x}\\\"\",\n      \"  filename      = \\\"${5:build/function.zip}\\\"\",\n      \"  source_code_hash = filebase64sha256(\\\"${5:build/function.zip}\\\")\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A Lambda function\"\n  },\n  \"Backend S3\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"tfbackend\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"terraform {\",\n      \"  backend \\\"s3\\\" {\",\n      \"    bucket = \\\"${1:state-bucket}\\\"\",\n      \"    key    = \\\"${2:app/terraform.tfstate}\\\"\",\n      \"    region = \\\"${3:eu-west-1}\\\"\",\n      \"  }\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"An S3 backend\"\n  },\n  \"Data AMI\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"tfami\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"data \\\"aws_ami\\\" \\\"al2023\\\" {\",\n      \"  most_recent = true\",\n      \"  owners      = [\\\"amazon\\\"]\",\n      \"  filter {\",\n      \"    name   = \\\"name\\\"\",\n      \"    values = [\\\"al2023-ami-*-x86_64\\\"]\",\n      \"  }\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"Latest Amazon Linux AMI\"\n  },\n  \"Route53 record\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"tfr53\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"resource \\\"aws_route53_record\\\" \\\"${1:www}\\\" {\",\n      \"  zone_id = ${2:var.zone_id}\",\n      \"  name    = \\\"${3:www.example.com}\\\"\",\n      \"  type    = \\\"${4:A}\\\"\",\n      \"  ttl     = 300\",\n      \"  records = [${5:aws_instance.web.public_ip}]\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A DNS record\"\n  }\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# Terraform AWS Snippets\n\nProvider, VPC, EC2, S3, IAM, RDS, security groups and outputs for Terraform on AWS.\n\nType a prefix and press Tab. 11 snippets.\n\n| Language | Prefix | What it inserts |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Terraform and HCL | `tfaws` | The AWS provider |\n| Terraform and HCL | `tfs3` | An S3 bucket |\n| Terraform and HCL | `tfec2` | An EC2 instance |\n| Terraform and HCL | `tfsg` | A security group |\n| Terraform and HCL | `tfvpc` | A VPC with a subnet |\n| Terraform and HCL | `tfiam` | An IAM role |\n| Terraform and HCL | `tfrds` | An RDS Postgres instance |\n| Terraform and HCL | `tflambda` | A Lambda function |\n| Terraform and HCL | `tfbackend` | An S3 backend |\n| Terraform and HCL | `tfami` | Latest Amazon Linux AMI |\n| Terraform and HCL | `tfr53` | A DNS record |\n\nThis extension runs no code and asks for no permissions.\n"}}}